      "updated": 1763304200305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23.19558182872256,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "• Verify all the signatures on the prekeys\n• Generate ephemeral EC key pair (EKA)\n• Generates a pqkem encapsulated shared secret\nand cipher text \n(CT, SS) = PQKEM-ENC(PQPKB)\n• Alice calculates:\n    • DH1 = DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n    • DH2 = DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n    • DH3 = DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n    • SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Verify all the signatures on the prekeys\n• Generate ephemeral EC key pair (EKA)\n• Generates a pqkem encapsulated shared secret and cipher text \n(CT, SS) = PQKEM-ENC(PQPKB)\n• Alice calculates:\n    • DH1 = DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n    • DH2 = DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n    • DH3 = DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n    • SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "a9",
      "autoResize": false
    },
